{"id": "68472", "title": "独家婚爱，权少惹不得", "author": "茗香宝儿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 66, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68472.htm", "intro": "她投/怀送抱，他乐见其成！\r\n  清醒过来的舒然离开时记住了他云淡风轻的温言：“别忘记了吃药！”\r\n  她莞尔一笑，潇洒离开。\r\n  ******\r\n  再见，他是上市公司的多金权少，她是教书育人的大学教师。\r\n  慈善晚宴上，当前任喜笑颜开地宣布喜讯，当她狼狈不堪地跌入水池中，他将她抱起，温文尔雅地笑谈：“舒然，是你招惹我的！”\r\n  ********\r\n  舒然没想过会这辈子会跟尚卿文这种人有交集，而且也从来没想过自己会真的这么倒霉地栽在他手里。\r\n  【遇见一个人，需要不快一分钟不慢一分钟的运气，只是当我回首时，是你，恰好留在了那里。】\r\n  *********\r\n  其实这是一个温暖的文，不过有虐也一定会有宠，茗香不当后妈好多年，嘎嘎！\r\n  茗香第六部作品，属于都市高干文，坑品保证，欢迎跳坑。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68472", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10530837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-30", "file": "10530838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-42", "file": "10530839.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-54", "file": "10530840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-64", "file": "10530841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "VIP章节 1-5", "file": "10530842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10530843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10530844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10530845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-26", "file": "10530846.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-30", "file": "10530847.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10530848.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10530849.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10530850.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10530851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10530852.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10530853.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10530854.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "10530855.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "10530856.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "10530857.html", "available": false}, {"title":